{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：02:08 2026-11-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：02:08 2026-11-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：02:08 2026-11-28 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35d12825aa316498ea2eb64835763011/2026-11/2026-11-27_18_06_00.png\"/><p>荔景邨今日（27日）發生墮樓事件。中午12時34分，警方接獲途人報案，指一名女子倒臥風景樓對開，懷疑從高處墮下。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，將昏迷的女事主送往瑪嘉烈醫院搶救，其後證實不治。</p><p>警方經初步調查，相信死者為風景樓一名72歲女住戶，從一個單位墮下。現場沒有檢獲遺書，死因有待驗屍確定。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T18:24:21.372080+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":225,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T18:08:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T22:48:08.885707+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T18:17:49.334625+00:00","content_hash":"a27e67487a20874ff209c480512af2ce050b627f9f5b3d8e40fe4b38f5ebac17","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}